title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf metarecord field replace
catalog: CLI command
target: mf metarecord field replace
summary: Replace one value of the field by another, the other values staying

!! Reference

```
Replace one value of the field by another, the other values staying

Usage: mf metarecord field replace [OPTIONS] <SPEC> [VALUE]

Arguments:
  <SPEC>
          Field spec name:type[=value] — the value to replace

  [VALUE]
          The new value alone, read as the type of the value replaced

Options:
      --nothing
          The new value is an absence (name:nothing)

      --type <VALUE_TYPE>
          The type of the new value, when the one replaced is `nothing`

  -f, --force
          

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
